      "content": "hold on, u mentioned orcs and goblins again. can we just stay on the database stuff? i don't really get the part about the dates being out of sync in the example. could u just give me a plain text example of an update anomaly? like, if i have an employee changing departments, how does an unnormalized table make that a mess?",
